        "### C. Contextual Embeddings (Deep Learning-based) - next class\n",
        "- Capture word meaning based on context\n",
        "\n",
        "**Examples:**\n",
        "1. **ELMo (2018)**\n",
        "   - Generates embeddings dynamically for each word in a sentence\n",
        "   - Uses bidirectional LSTM\n",
        "\n",
        "2. **BERT (2018)**\n",
        "   - Transformer-based embeddings\n",
        "   - Captures bidirectional context\n",
        "   - Pretrained, can be fine-tuned for downstream NLP tasks\n",
        "\n",
        "3. **GPT, RoBERTa, XLNet**\n",
        "   - Variants of transformer-based embeddings\n",
        "   - Useful for language modeling and NLP tasks\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 3. Key Properties\n",
        "- **Semantic similarity:** Similar words have closer vectors\n",
        "- **Vector arithmetic:** Captures analogies (`king – man + woman ≈ queen`)\n",
        "- **Dimensionality reduction:** Dense representation is memory efficient\n",
        "- **Transferable:** Pretrained embeddings can be reused\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 4. Evaluation Metrics\n",
        "**Intrinsic Evaluation**\n",
        "- Word similarity (e.g., cosine similarity between “king” & “queen”)\n",
        "- Word analogy tasks\n",
        "\n",
        "**Extrinsic Evaluation**\n",
        "- Performance on NLP tasks (text classification, NER, sentiment analysis)\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 5. Applications\n",
        "- Sentiment analysis\n",
        "- Named Entity Recognition (NER)\n",
        "- Machine Translation\n",
        "- Text Classification\n",
        "- Question Answering\n",
        "- Chatbots and conversational AI\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## ✅ Quick Summary Table\n",
        "\n",
        "| Model     | Type               | Context Handling | Pros                          | Cons                        |\n",
        "|-----------|------------------|----------------|-------------------------------|----------------------------|\n",
        "| Word2Vec  | Prediction-based  | Static         | Simple, captures analogies    | Cannot handle rare words    |\n",
        "| GloVe     | Hybrid            | Static         | Efficient on large corpus     | Static embeddings           |\n",
        "| FastText  | Prediction-based  | Static + subwords | Handles rare words & morphology | Larger vectors          |\n",
        "| ELMo (DL)     | Contextual        | Dynamic        | Context-aware                 | Slow, large model           |\n",
        "| BERT   (DL)   | Contextual        | Dynamic        | Context-aware, bidirectional | Heavy, requires fine-tuning |\n"
      ]
